'''Alolan Dugtrio ex''' (Japanese: '''アローラダグトリオex''' ''Alolan Dugtrio ex'') is a {{ct|Metal}} Stage 1 {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Extradimensional Crisis}} expansion.

